%!PS
/r { 0 0 3 -1 roll 1 rectfill } def
/b { { 1 } { 0 } ifelse r } def
/s { length r } def
/e { stopped b } def
save /tmp 7 def tmp r restore /tmp where b
/a [1 2] def save a 0 9 put a 0 get r restore a 0 get r
save 0.5 setgray restore 0 0 5 5 rectfill
save save restore restore 4 r
{ 5 restore } e { restore } e
